name: ping-alert
displayName: Ping Alert
author: m3rcur1e
version: "1.0.1"
minGameVersion: "160"
hidden: true
description: "Teammates' pings are hard to miss: a sound, a chat line with the coordinates, an arrow at the screen edge pointing to an off-screen ping and a card with a live view of the pinged place (click it to look there). Each part can be switched off in Settings."
